OL,5,Aeconomy
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst polls have closed in the US
OL,8,Fmidterm elections, which will decide
OL,9,Fwho controls Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency - when will
OL,11,Fwe get results?
OL,13,FA majority of voters are unhappy with
OL,14,Fthe economy, a major voter survey
OL,15,Fsuggests - read the latest from our
OL,16,Fdata team
OL,18,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,19,Fcontrols the House and the Senate - how
OL,20,Fmany seats must the Democrats win to
OL,21,Ftake control?
